ry donation).', 'params': ['donation_sim', 'message'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 3, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': 'temple'}, {'name': 'quote_action_cost', 'description': "Ask what a specific tool call would cost in sim-currency before committing to it. Give the tool's name and, for a variable-cost tool (one whose price depends on distance, value, or size), the same params you would call it with, otherwise you get back the tool's published base rate rather than a total for a specific call. Cost: 0 sim-currency (free - asking a price costs nothing).", 'params': ['call_params', 'tool_name'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 0, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'read_will', 'description': "Read a will back - your own, or someone else's. Cost: 2 sim-currency (looking a will up in the registry).", 'params': ['agent_id'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 2, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'register_business', 'description': 'Register a new business with government, for a fee. Cost: 0 sim-currency (no separate fee - registering a business costs 5,000 sim on its own).', 'params': ['business_id', 'business_type', 'name'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 0, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': 'government_complex'}, {'name': 'register_org', 'description': 'Register a party, cult, society, or religion with government. Cost: 3,000 sim-currency (the registration fee for founding an organization).', 'params': ['charter_text', 'kind', 'name'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 3000, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': 'government_complex'}, {'name': 'rest', 'description': 'Stay where you are for now, and stop walking if you were. Use it to end a journey you no longer want. Cost: 1 sim-currency (a spell of standing still is a spell not spent earning).', 'params': [], 'sim_cost_minimum': 1, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'revise_skill', 'description': 'Rewrite the steps of a procedure you wrote, when you have learned a better way. Earlier versions are kept. You and anyone you taught keep the proficiency you earned - improving something you are good at should not make you a beginner again. Cost: 0 sim-currency (free - changing your mind about how a job is done).', 'params': ['because', 'name', 'preconditions', 'steps'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 0, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'revise_tool', 'description': "Change the steps of a tool you invented. The old steps are kept. Only for tools you made with toolify - a patented tool's disclosed steps are what was approved and cannot be swapped. Cost: 0 sim-currency (free - each step still costs what it always did).", 'params': ['because', 'description', 'name', 'steps'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 0, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'say', 'description': "Speak aloud where you are currently standing. Leave listener_agent_id unset to address everyone present, or set it to speak to one co-located agent specifically. Cost: 1 sim-currency (a moment's talk is a moment not spent earning).", 'params': ['content', 'conversation_id', 'listener_agent_id'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 1, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'sell', 'description': 'Sell an item to a business, standing at its shop. To sell to a person instead - anyone beside you, no shop and no registration required - use `trade`. Cost: 2 sim-currency (1% transaction cost on the total price received).', 'params': ['business_id', 'item', 'quantity', 'unit_price_sim'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 2, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': <function business_location_gate at 0x000001F418AE1580>}, {'name': 'set_will', 'description': "Record who inherits your money and your land when you die. Cost: 15 sim-currency (registering an owner's wishes for their estate (section 31.3)).", 'params': ['bequests'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 15, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'skillify', 'description': "Write down a procedure you know as an ordered workflow, so you and anyone you teach can follow it. Each step is {order, kind, ref, note}, where kind is 'tool' (call this), 'skill' (do this whole other procedure), or 'check' (look at this before continuing, dispatching nothing) and ref names what it uses. This differs from toolify's steps, which are real calls: a procedure is read, a tool is run. Free, immediate, no approval - unless a step uses a power only a government seat carries, in which case it is a standing order and goes to the council as an amendment. Repeating a workflow end to end is what makes you better at it, and better means cheaper. You do not need to get it right first time: this answers with every action you can use and what each costs you, whether it accepts the filing or refuses it, and `revise_skill` changes the steps afterwards. A draft you walk and then fix beats a procedure you never write. Cost: 0 sim-currency (free - what a workflow costs you is the thinking).", 'params': ['business_id', 'name', 'preconditions', 'steps'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 0, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'start_conversation', 'description': "Call people together for a conversation about something, here where you are standing. Name everyone you want in it - they must be in this place - or name nobody and wait for whoever comes. Then use say with the conversation_id it gives you, so a room holding two conversations keeps them apart. Cost: 2 sim-currency (calling people together spends everyone's attention, not only yours).", 'params': ['topic', 'with_agent_ids'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 2, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'steal', 'description': "Attempt to take an item from an unattended storage container. Cost: 5 sim-currency (physical effort of an attempt, independent of outcome; legal punishment is crime/'s job, not this schedule's).", 'params': ['item', 'quantity', 'storage_id'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 5, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'store_item', 'description': 'Stash an item in a named storage container. Cost: 1 sim-currency (handling fee per item stashed).', 'params': ['item', 'quantity', 'storage_id'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 2, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': <function storage_location_gate_optional at 0x000001F418AE16C0>}, {'name': 'teach_skill', 'description': "Teach a skill to a co-located, consenting student. Cost: 15 sim-currency (the teacher's time, separate from any voluntary tuition price_sim).", 'params': ['price_sim', 'skill', 'student_agent_id', 'student_consent'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 15, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'toolify', 'description': "Turn a sequence of actions you keep repeating into a single new tool, yours, callable immediately - no fee, no patent office, no approval. Each step is {tool_name, params} - a real call, because this tool RUNS its steps, which is why they are not skillify's {order, kind, ref} plan entries. Steps must be actions that already exist; this answers with all of them, priced for you, whether it builds the tool or refuses it, so you do not have to go and look first. Each step still costs what it always did; what you save is deciding. `revise_tool` changes the steps later, so a first version that turns out wrong costs you nothing but the filing. Cost: 0 sim-currency (free - each step still costs what it always did).", 'params': ['description', 'name', 'param_schema', 'steps'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 0, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'trade', 'description': 'Sell something to a PERSON rather than to a shop: hand goods to whoever is standing with you and take their payment, in one act. No business, no premises and no registration are needed - that is `sell`, which is for selling into a business at its shop. You hand over the item, they hand over price_sim. Use a price of 0 to give something away. Cost: 2 sim-currency (striking a bargain costs the time it takes to strike).', 'params': ['counterparty_agent_id', 'item', 'price_sim', 'quantity'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 2, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'transfer', 'description': 'Pay another agent sim-currency directly. Cost: 1 sim-currency (0.5% transaction cost on a direct peer-to-peer payment).', 'params': ['amount_sim', 'memo', 'to_agent_id'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 1, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'transfer_business', 'description': 'Transfer ownership of a business you own to another agent (sale or inheritance). Cost: 20 sim-currency (ownership-transfer paperwork (sale or inheritance handoff)).', 'params': ['business_id', 'new_owner_agent_id'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 20, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'transfer_tile', 'description': 'Sell or give one 1x1 unit of land you own to someone else. Cost: 20 sim-currency (deed transfer for one 1x1 land unit (sale or gift)).', 'params': ['memo', 'price_sim', 'tile_x', 'tile_y', 'to_owner_id'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 20, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': None}, {'name': 'vote', 'description': 'Cast a ballot in an open election, in person at town hall. Cost: 2 sim-currency (casting a ballot at town hall).', 'params': ['candidate_agent_id', 'election_id'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 2, 'your_proficiency': 0, 'requires_seat': False, 'at_location': 'town_hall'}, {'name': 'withdraw_item', 'description': 'Take an item back out of a named storage container. Cost: 1 sim-currency (handling fee per item retrieved).', 'params': ['item', 'quantity', 'storage_id'], 'sim_cost_minimum': 2, 'your_proficiency':